description = "The old goblin accepts your payment, counts the coins twice, and records your entry in a thick ledger.

“You’re registered, {TITLE}. Choose your mare and get her ready in the preparation area. An attendant will inspect her equipment and assign you a starting stall.”

He hands you a numbered ribbon before immediately turning his attention to the next racer."
